=== camphelp 28
Swap: receive
This section contains items you are offered as a swap for something else. You may agree or refuse to swap. The swap will happen when both parties agree.

=== camphelp 29
Swap: offer
This section contains items you offer to swap for something else. You may agree or refuse to swap. The swap will happen when both parties agree.

